      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat uses the SkeletalTrackingLevel to determine what mode it should be in.\n\nSo the issues you have described are coming from drivers not correctly reporting it.\n\nFor example VD is always stuck in finger Tracking Mode due to it always reporting to have Full Skeletal Tracking. Same would go for ALVR, they always seem to report to not have full skeletal tracking.\n\nYou can read more about this here:\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/platforms/pc/steamvr-drivers/",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "66a2dc5f880a6abb1e35b60c",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
